    <string name="tutorial_step_counter">Step %1$d of 4</string>
    <string name="tut_1_title">1. Turn On Your Phone VPN</string>
    <string name="tut_1_desc">Open your favorite VPN app (WireGuard, ProtonVPN, Mullvad, OpenVPN) and connect first. Zero-Config will show \"VPN BOUND\" at the top.</string>
    <string name="tut_2_title">2. Start Zero-Config Hub</string>
    <string name="tut_2_desc">Tap \"Start Zero-Config Hub\" on the Hub tab. Keep Battery Optimization disabled so Android does not pause your connection when the screen locks.</string>
    <string name="tut_3_title">3. Connect Phone to Your PC</string>
    <string name="tut_3_desc">Plug your USB cable and enable USB Tethering (fastest, zero Wi-Fi lag) — or keep phone and PC on the same Wi-Fi — or enable USB Debugging (ADB).</string>
    <string name="tut_4_title">4. Zero-Config Smart TV &amp; Devices</string>
    <string name="tut_4_desc">Run ZeroConfigBridge.exe on Windows and click \"Connect &amp; Share VPN\". Your Smart TV or other phones simply join the Windows hotspot with zero proxy setup! (Or use HTTP :8080 directly without a PC.)</string>
